water, whether you're a sailor, a kayaker, or just someone who likes to take a stroll along the beach. They're like\u001b[0m \u001b[0m\na treasure map for the tides!\", \"register\": \"warm\", \"prompt\": \"set the topic to harbor tides, and tell me what you thin\u001b[0mk\u001b[0m\n about tidal atlases\", \"engine\": \"live-ollama:llama3.2\", \"fidelity\": {\"grounded\": true}}}, \"claimant\": \"persona:marisol\u001b[0m\"\u001b[0m\n, \"certainty\": 0.9, \"applicability\": 1.0, \"basis\": {\"kind\": \"generated\"}, \"supersedes\": null, \"links\": [], \"tags\": [], \u001b[0m\"\u001b[0m\nmeta\": {}}\n1153:{\"id\": \"a-bda88dfb9762\", \"at\": 1795425864307, \"subject\": \"persona:persona-051d2365a4d4\", \"predicate\": \"persona:rep\u001b[0ml\u001b[0m\ny\", \"value\": {\"type\": \"map\", \"v\": {\"text\": \"Tidal atlases. Valuable resources. Allow for precise planning, especially f\u001b[0mo\u001b[0m\nr sailors and coastal engineers. My opinion: most comprehensive ones include historical data, illustrating tidal patter\u001b[0mn\u001b[0m\ns over time. However, their accuracy can vary depending on the source and methodology. Some may prioritize reliability \u001b[0mo\u001b[0m\nver detail, while others may sacrifice reliability for more comprehensive coverage. Three is not a number, but a reason\u001b[0ma\u001b[0m\nble amount to consider when evaluating a tidal atlas.\", \"register\": \"clipped\", \"prompt\": \"3\", \"engine\": \"live-ollama:ll\u001b[0ma\u001b[0m\nma3.2\", \"fidelity\": {\"grounded\": true}}}, \"claimant\": \"persona:quill\", \"certainty\": 0.9, \"applicability\": 1.0, \"basis\":\u001b[0m \u001b[0m\n{\"kind\": \"generated\"}, \"supersedes\": null, \"links\": [], \"tags\": [], \"meta\": {}}\n1156:{\"id\": \"a-b51460d63cba\", \"at\": 1795425864308, \"subject\": \"persona:persona-d8df17c1cf35\", \"predicate\": \"persona:rep\u001b[0ml\u001b[0m\ny\", \"value\": {\"type\": \"map\", \"v\": {\"text\": \"It seems like we haven't quite gotten started on our topic 