{"jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"session/update","params":{"sessionId":"rich-moth","update":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_thought_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"\n\nThe `S-faithful-voice` scenario score is low at 0.4 because it failed to meet the amended source-accuracy bar. While four retrieval attempts were made, none resulted in hits or source uses. The only factual answer provided, concerning Harrisburg, was derived through the reaction path with a null fidelity and no ungrounded-claim flag. Earlier safe answers were grounded only against stale context, not the actual query."},"_meta":{"cognition.ai/timestamp":"2026-11-23T17:17:40.574095500+00:00"}}}}
{"jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"session/update","params":{"sessionId":"rich-moth","update":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_thought_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"\n\nCycle 4 significantly improves launch hygiene, roster/theme/Library controls, canonical enactments, and inline scenario evidence. However, C-ConnectorSet is not accounted for, the readiness gate's `can_query` check is flawed, candidate ranking bypasses template slot tests, and several S- scenarios produced inaccurate or ungrounded claims. Fleet install/discovery and QR/AVQR exchange media remain declared absences. No frontier-model escalation is needed due to sufficient evidence."},"_meta":{"cognition.ai/timestamp":"2026-11-23T17:17:41.394042300+00:00"}}}}
